makeOblong in main
makeOblong invokes shapes.Rectangle.new
makeOblong argument width Int64 three copy
makeOblong argument height Int64 four copy
makeOblong result oblong shapes.Rectangle
makeOblong ownedBy none
makeOblong cleanedBy none
makeOblong borrows none
makeOblong catch none
makeOblong suppresses none

